	)
	(text "OPA2388 A: MID + 16 x LPF(AN1_P - AN1_N) (100k / 1.60M || 620p C0G); B buffers MID. 5V_B ladder 2.1k/402R/402R/2.1k\n(0.1 %, ratiometric): trips at +5.02 / -5.02 A. TLV3502 out LOW = trip -> TRIP_N. AMC3330 fail-safe\n(-2.57 V, HV side dead) and an open AN1 line trip it too."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 331.324 274.808 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4eedcbaa-c06a-5586-955f-3d475e3bd09c")
	)
	(text "AN2: APWM (L1 driver, 400 kHz, duty 88-10 % for AIN 0.6-4.5 V) -> 10.0k / 100k / 1 uF (tau 10 ms) ->\nfollower: 0.9 x 3.3 V x duty, 0.2-2.8 V. AN3: REF3030E 3.0 V -> 100R -> NTC -> 3.65k -> GND, follower, 0-2.92 V.\nOutputs 49.9R (CTRL: <= 100 R source), single-ended on AGND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 362.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "568b2d0b-44e5-5a11-85ed-4d5fe68b5248")
	)
	(text "TRANSFORMER SECONDARY CURRENT: HOB 130-P (DC-1 MHZ, +/-250 A, 8 MV/A)"
