				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "781f3bd0-255c-5a57-9aaf-1a66eda1de65")
	)
	(text "REF3030E ladder 909R/1.69k/412R (0.1 %) on H5V: trips at +211.1 / -209.9 A on Uout/2 (20.0k/20.0k + 10 pF). TLV3502 out\nHIGH = OK -> ISO7720F (default LOW: a dead HV side reads TRIP) -> OCH_OK / OCL_OK. ~0.78 us to the gate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 278.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7bf20645-22a5-5d09-a3d9-ab320197b2fa")
	)
	(text "OPA4388 A: INP = Vcm + k(Uout - Uref), B: INN = Vcm - k(Uout - Uref): R1 = R3 = 10k, R2 = 1.56k, + leg divider\n7.87k / 1.96k from Uref_B (Vcm 0.500 V, R_th ~ R2). VIN = 0.3128 (Uout - Uref) -> AN1 = 5.005 mV/A differential:\n0 A = 0 V, +/-1.25 V at +/-250 A, +/-1.56 V at the HOB rails; CTRL G 0.402 -> 0.62-1.88 V at its ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 194.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b13723ff-c291-5418-91c2-632dbd03b04f")
	)
	(text "AN2 MODULE TEMPERATURE, AN3 COLDPLATE / COOLANT INLET (PELV)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 290.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b61f808c-4e3b-5fef-ad45-be74d9524111")
	)
	(text "Its secondary lives on the HV2 side, referenced to the bridge DC- (P2_BUS-, one 0R Kelvin tie at the bank), so\nprimary-secondary sees only functional stress. HV2 -> PELV crosses three reinforced parts: UCC12050 power\n(VIOWM 1697 VDC), AMC3330 AN1 (1700 VDC), ISO7720F OC trips (2121 VDC). ECO-10: reinforced creepage at\nthese footprints (8 mm packages < 10 mm at PD2 / 1000 V: PD1 coating or slots, as PV-PORT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 91.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2acf799-6055-5259-997a-b94440ab504a")
	)
	(text "INSULATION: THE HOB 130-P IS NOT THE PELV BARRIER (BASIC 1000 V ONLY)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d64f4537-b77d-58c5-9547-ba6d0d33a12a")
	)
	(text "AN1 DRIVER -> AMC3330 (+/-1 V IN, GAIN 2, 1.44 V CM OUT, 0.2 OHM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 104.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e7d63cbf-10c5-5e32-a66f-d855e9342126")
	)
	(text "Primary jumper in the AC path B2_ACA -> XS_A (positive = out of leg A). LEM p12 filter 10R / 4.7n on Uout.\nOPA4388 D buffers Uout (Rout 30 ohm), C buffers Uref (130-300 ohm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.544 74.532 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec55d19a-c822-5387-82e8-007977dc2e3d")
	)
	(text "DC-FLUX WINDOW +/-5 A ON AN1 (PELV, TAU 0.99 MS)"
